{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12388","headline":"送蒋尚书居守东都 · 钱起","name":"送蒋尚书居守东都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤辇幸秦久，周人徯帝情。\n若非君敏德，谁镇洛阳城。\n前席命才彦，举朝推令名。\n纶言动北斗，职事守东京。\n郑履下天去，蘧轮满路声。\n出关秋树直，对阙远山明。\n肃肃保厘处，水流宫苑清。\n长安日西笑，朝夕衮衣迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}